//! End-to-end tests for the native schema v2 delivery path.
//!
//! These tests never download anything and never run Node. The engine probe is
//! injected; the Rust entry points are tiny shell fixtures generated by the
//! test itself, so no downloaded or untrusted binary is executed. They cover
//! the manifest v2 model, exact tree verification, activation probes,
//! transaction recovery, rollback refusal and legacy read-only migration.

